["JOB_STATUS : OKAY, wenn fehlerfrei","STAT_LAMPSTS : Open Lamp detection: 0: Unterbrechung","STAT_SPG_EIN : 0 = interne 5Vg ein","STAT_SEPIC : 1: interne +/- 10V aktiv","STAT_CCFL_SLEEP : 1 = CCFL Converter On, 0 = off","STAT_LVDS_SLEEP : 1 = LVDS Interface On, 0 = off","STAT_POWERFAIL : Komparator 5V-Regler Low: Unterspannung","STAT_DIR_HOR : Bildlage: 0=Vertikal, 1= Horizontal","STAT_POSSWITCH_RR : Endschalter Position RR-Monitore 1= Monitor Off","STAT_BUTTON_CLOSE : 1 = Button active","STAT_BUTTON_PLUS : 1 = Button active","STAT_BUTTON_MINUS : 1 = Button active","STAT_BUTTON_OPEN : 1 = Button active","_TEL_ANTWORT : Hex-Antwort von SG"]